<title>USA: La Jolla names Engle as chairman.</title>
<headline>La Jolla names Engle as chairman.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>La Jolla Pharmaceutical Co said Monday it has elected President and Chief Executive Officer Steven Engle as chairman of its board of directors.</p>
<p>He replaces Joseph Stemler, chairman for the past eight years, who will continue on the board.</p>
<p>Engle joined La Jolla Pharmaceutical in 1993, became president in 1994 and chief executive officer in 1995.</p>
